etal. Diego's character uses 52 item slots of wood and metal crafting materials while making the items. 4. Sunflower seeds for birds cost $2.50 per pound and a generic birdseed costs $1.25 per pound. An order of some of each type of bird seed weighs 15 pounds and costs $25.00."),extraction_status(complete),blocker(none),visual_provenance([]))}).

defragged_task_instance(im_defrag_9c1a0597bc49b748b95239f4_1,
    'IM-G8-U4-L15',
