    defragged_task{evidence_sha256:"8b17fd3da610ee23a81e96961fa40723ec42199cbdeb9d854b202d68b2a049af", status:already_complete, blocker:none, complete_statement:"1. The graph shows the amount of garbage produced in the United States each year between 1991 and 2013. a. Did the amount of garbage increase or decrease between 1999 and 2000? b. Did the amount of garbage increase or decrease between 2005 and 2009? c. Between 1991 and 1995, the garbage increased for three years, and then it decreased in the fourth year. Describe how the amount of garbage changed in the years between 1995 and 2000. 2. The graph shows the percentage of garbage that was recycled between 1991 and 2013. a. When is the graph increasing? b. When is the graph decreasing? c. Tell the story of the change in the percentage of garbage recycled in the United States over the time period shown in the graph.", statement_joiner:" ", statement_segments:[seg_49d6ff7d0b9443e7c813, seg_677bf580a2cede73befc, seg_fe0a6b5a92e7c76290c9, seg_249855037a1dfadbc5b0, seg_b82608da12aaa9c04264, seg_ccb7fba8f825b45b6f09, seg_1fdd22f228214ea6e86f, seg_b410a6e9e46355d8d030], source_statement:"1. The graph shows the amount of garbage produced in the United States each year between 1991 and 2013. a. Did the amount of garbage increase or decrease between 1999 and 2000? b. Did the amount of garbage increase or decrease between 2005 and 2009? c. Between 1991 and 1995, the garbage increased for three years, and then it decreased in the fourth year. Describe how the amount of garbage changed in the years between 1995 and 2000. 2. The graph shows the percentage of garbage that was recycled between 1991 and 2013. a. When is the graph increasing? b. When is the graph decreasing? c. Tell the story of the change in the percentage of garbage recycled in the United States over the time period shown in the graph.", source_statement_joiner:" ", source_statement_segments:[seg_49d6ff7d0b9443e7c813, seg_677bf580a2cede73befc, seg_fe0a6b5a92e7c