banks, AK      |                      64.84 |                                 55 | | Juneau, AK         |                      58.34 |                                 56 | | Kansas City, MO    |                      39.10 |                                 80 | | Lincoln, NE        |                      40.81 |                                 80 | | Miami, FL          |                      25.76 |                                 89 | | Minneapolis, MN    |                      44.98 |                                 73 | | New York City, NY  |                      40.71 |                                 76 | | Orlando, FL        |                      28.54 |                                 92 | | Philadelphia, PA   |                      39.95 |                                 79 | | Portland, ME       |                      43.66 |                                 71 | | Puerto Morelos, MX |                      20.89 |                                 89 | | San Antonio, TX    |                      29.42 |                                 90 | | San Francisco, CA  |                      37.78 |                                 70 | | Seattle, WA        |                      47.61 |                                 72 | | Tampa, FL          |                      27.95 |                                 89 | | Tucson, AZ         |                      32.25 |                                 96 | | Yellowknife, NT    |                      62.45 |                                 50 | 1. What information does each row hold? 2. What is the range for each variable? 3. Do you see an association between the two variables? If so, describe the association."),extraction_status(complete),blocker(none),visual_provenance([]))}).

