ents walk or ride their bikes than ride in a van. 2. Fill in the blanks as directed by your teacher. Then answer each question. a. \u201cHow many more students ___ than ?\u201d ___ b. \u201cHow many more students ___ or ___ than ?\u201d ___"), admission(unclaimed_student_task_statement))}).

