 table. Be prepared to explain your reasoning. about 100 not about 100 2. Now decide if the number of people in each part of the school is close to 0, close to 100, or close to 200. If you don\u2019t think a number belongs in any column, set it aside. Be prepared to explain your reasoning. close to 0 close to 100 close"), admission(unclaimed_student_task_statement))}).

