    defragged_task{evidence_sha256:"388537cbbf01e2b5affecfea883d60ea47facb788800d0ed64d8bc0193cf834a", status:already_complete, blocker:none, complete_statement:"1. Solve 1 of the problems. Explain or show your reasoning. a. Jada has 326 beads. She gives her friend 32 beads. Then Jada uses 84 beads to make a bracelet. How many beads does Jada have now? b. Noah starts an art project on Monday by using 624 beads. On Tuesday, he uses 132 more beads. On Wednesday, he finishes the project by using 48 more beads. How many beads did Noah use on his art project? 2. Trade work with a partner. Decide whether your partner\u2019s answer for their problem makes sense. On their paper, explain your reasoning.", statement_joiner:" ", statement_segments:[seg_faec492c6daae529b1f8, seg_09cd9c1a51d2ed22a2fc, seg_195a21dec80711dbeb8d, seg_cb747325d5fa7e3da962, seg_b2180d2aaf911fc7a607, seg_a7a2b441eda0e0e92ca3, seg_fe9c0dca755d4858484b, seg_c229a4ff1ecc67efc077, seg_74f0f1f5ac7460d4e143, seg_38858167858c02c45b76, seg_a9f5efc730088557ddf6, seg_bb293a5d8edad3cc1dde, seg_5b58877283eeb50a61c7, seg_adffc692f0cae0df2a84, seg_67ebf0488d1a634a3771], source_statement:"1. Solve 1 of the problems. Explain or show your reasoning. a. Jada has 326 beads. She gives her friend 32 beads. Then Jada uses 84 beads to make a bracelet. How many beads does Jada have now? b. Noah starts an art project on Monday by using 624 beads. On Tuesday, he uses 132 more beads. On Wednesday, he finishes the project by using 48 more beads. How many beads did Noah use on his art project? 2. Trade work with a partner. Decide whether your partner\u2019s answer for their problem makes sense. On their paper, explain your reasoning.", source_statement_joiner:" ", source_statement_segments:[seg_faec492c6daae529b1f8, seg_09cd9c1a51d2ed22a2fc, seg_195a21dec80711dbeb8d, seg_cb747325d5fa7e3da962, seg_b2180d2aaf911fc7a607, seg_a7a2b441eda0e0e92ca3, seg_fe9c0dca755d4858484b, seg_c229a4ff1ecc67efc077, seg_74f0f1f5ac7460d4e143, seg_38858