    defragged_task{evidence_sha256:"abaed8bc6e2d348704c00f7f5f68c86a93f6ec987914ae7ecbbce9547a5bc6f9", status:already_complete, blocker:none, complete_statement:"Spinning tops are popular around the world. Here are spinning tops from a few different cultures. Match each situation about spinning tops with an expression that can represent it. 1. Clare has a collection of 24 A. spinning tops in 4 colors. She has the same number of tops in black, white, red, and green. How many tops of each color does she have? 2. Priya and her friend decorate B. 24 wooden tops with paint. Each person paints the same number of tops. How many tops does each person paint? 3. A store has 24 tops from C. around the world displayed in 6 boxes. Each box contains the same number of tops. How many tops are in each box? 4. Diego has 12 trompos (trohm- D. pohs) to give as gifts. He gives each friend 2 trompos. How many friends get trompos as gifts? 5. Six friends make 12 dreidels E. (dray-duhls). Each friend makes the same number of dreidels. How many dreidels does each friend make?", statement_joiner:" ", statement_segments:[seg_0a1be5084305e6499c38, seg_6841efb2355bfc104f15, seg_b105817c3f796ae1cdc3, seg_4e99f892899155a1b7d3, seg_df299c01cde3b072f49b, seg_d6f1b62c8ac9bcee8af0, seg_72b605050288911ef8d5, seg_8ecf8b5fcc9d61686761, seg_3796c71b84b2f10b38ec, seg_bbdb4172cd4ece3f7b99, seg_77eec08b3cb1572ca914, seg_c314cba297e28e977766, seg_f3d020478a15767ad201, seg_c490b0ac634c3b10d8b0, seg_9a00b53096e39ad6d794, seg_9270f7aef36ccd2a244e, seg_ba89480f9ea2edae8284, seg_038b781bd504dd955b83, seg_d7aa235f8d6e966306ad, seg_faaed30e2044cbf090dc, seg_783181966e8b6053afea, seg_86b199f49381e4c0d5d9, seg_74fb2e762b6e9a71cb5e, seg_b9717ef83533c24be6f9, seg_9953f235d89043006bb9, seg_84853de77ffef0fc0ecf, seg_ff0b108289e33bfd5e18, seg_f69e9e9b27439a46dab0, seg_fec6852aadbf9929d92a, seg_c2dfc80fc611b6f5d9f2, seg_516f6f10849c79ecc1e1, seg_6e78053d2984f28efbed, seg_a28f4afa8202baa402eb, seg_5dfb972270067ef1b4d8, seg