terpillar crawled of the length of the same log. Which insect crawled farther? 2. A grasshopper is 4 centimeters long. A caterpillar is centimeters long. Which insect is longer? 3. A ladybug crawled of the length of a branch. An ant crawled of the length of the same branch. Which insect crawled farther? 4. A grasshopper jumped of the width of the sidewalk. A frog jumped of the width of the same sidewalk. Which creature jumped a longer distance?"), admission(unclaimed_student_task_statement))}).

