dishes, cups, forks, Prices vary. Research spoons, etc. or estimate cost. dishwasher $389 portable stove $174 Prices vary. Research furniture or estimate cost. compact washer/ $225 dryer combination bed $189"), admission(unclaimed_student_task_statement))}).

