ides/grade4/unit3/lesson14.md', lines(182, 223)), position(student_task_statement(2)), excerpt("Students in a fourth-grade class collect data on their shoe sizes and lengths. They plot the shoe lengths on a line plot. The line plot is missing 9 the shoe lengths of 6 students. 1. Complete the line plot with the missing data. 2. Use the completed line plot to answer the following questions: a. What is the longest shoe length, in inches? b. What is the shortest shoe length, in inches? c. What is the difference between the longest and shortest shoe lengths, in inches? Explain or show your reasoning. d. The student who records 9 inches for her shoe length makes a mistake when reading the shoe chart. Her actual shoe length is inches shorter. What is her shoe length, in inches? Plot her corrected data point on the line plot."), admission(unclaimed_student_task_statement))}).

