    defragged_task{evidence_sha256:"63d74764b443c76f22fec61d8a41c192df0450e3488852e2828359d911b5a084", status:already_complete, blocker:none, complete_statement:"There are 10 students that record their shoe lengths in third grade and then again in fourth grade. They found how much their feet have grown over a year and organize the data in a table and on a line plot. change change in shoe in shoe student length student length (inches) (inches) Jada Clare Tyler Priya Andre Kiran Elena Diego Han Lin 1. The line plot shows only 7 points. Whose information is missing? Add the 3 missing points to the line plot. 2. If Han\u2019s shoe length now is inches, what was his shoe length in third grade? 3. If Priya\u2019s shoe length was inches last year, what\u2019s her shoe length this year? 4. Tyler makes a calculation error. What he records, inches, was inches off from the actual change in shoe length. a. What could be the actual change in his shoe length? Explain or show your reasoning. b. How does his error change the line plot? Explain your reasoning.", statement_joiner:" ", statement_segments:[seg_9688495b406953aa993f, seg_e5e644b90998c12c8954, seg_09c6570f9f47fe3aba0e, seg_50bf7879138baa1a8bdd, seg_57f07ab5301d6744871b, seg_caec0d7cab91894ee733, seg_d7092aeb8a43681d6e7c, seg_6e8f14af38fefb165822, seg_87600996dcc925e88985, seg_1dc077b9ddc081bcc223, seg_b2be42d06d18b18bc61d, seg_50f5ecfc771d10a38421, seg_ff27341915c7ab6edb18, seg_7ae216c512ec5d5962b8, seg_00ee6dd6225710922ece, seg_5c6a2bc98c00a1116963, seg_b618aeccf5b37be8b576, seg_d2e032a16d06debc1fde, seg_4f647d7795269bfee81c, seg_aa826e1eaf4645f9e74a, seg_e22b81dd613964cbfd9d, seg_79d49e38e00864d226ab, seg_03dbf7f081f1390ee22c, seg_b2c58672208849a09eb4, seg_1d38cab0756035feb1b5, seg_5c2d061c57b2e45a4de8, seg_59ea1ed4077f9faf672b, seg_2bca99d2d343b1d5a865, seg_baeb25e11f50b8acd8f5, seg_de6a1a4a23d2c3e15a52, seg_195e8e1e639d7e953858, seg_ec907cb8e61078886d45, seg_79a3e51eff077058f800, seg_9094ff69839cb654f658, seg_131c4983