    defragged_task{evidence_sha256:"edef8f4bc658baa58b87831bb88667f9770828e0c3475d1f0b31e545237c63f9", status:already_complete, blocker:none, complete_statement:"Mai and her friends had a video game tournament one weekend. Here are the scores at the end of the tournament. player score Mai 93,005 Priya 101,012 Kiran 90,298 Noah 90,056 Clare 98,032 Elena 89,100 Andre -- 1. Rank the scores from highest to lowest. Who is in first place? 2. Andre\u2019s score was accidentally deleted but everyone agreed he is in second place. Could Andre\u2019s score be a six-digit number? Describe what Andre\u2019s score could be and give a couple of examples.", statement_joiner:" ", statement_segments:[seg_86b794a17c4b1e4b6a66, seg_77ea5bfbfb98e25de8f7, seg_a2960fc065b33c5edec2, seg_588fb9f0c705d1ef2fc7, seg_ba84f23ecf80da853e97, seg_0e626d499a3f005aec9f, seg_643d3150c2cda5515493, seg_c5ba3110c38c68aec789, seg_9a7ef6a434e3ca869f74, seg_90f36c0d25f74daa9530, seg_aa834267deaf6e1ee8ab, seg_88fc4fb0eff92f05ada2, seg_70099ceda13faae36783, seg_c1a5bcdcfd6574983c38, seg_415f39f8809d9cf9ed18, seg_824d3144f11e2ebc4dab, seg_5a4edb10753a242d059a, seg_e0f82b2ad0dab02045e2, seg_8ed7bff68e23c5fc6227, seg_82aa4aa68436935b4ad8, seg_b187b045d73f7c1b3d59, seg_b6dd02811d6246c7faa1, seg_3e9478243b43b9633963, seg_1c153861f22e519d5347, seg_4423d50f7998472214ff, seg_2ed8e4fb8315fa998249, seg_73c68a77c30984ff9282, seg_1398b2c4aff9d6f69e9e, seg_4559d5bdeebb76ac498f, seg_d0ebefca0676d9ea8d77], source_statement:"Mai and her friends had a video game tournament one weekend. Here are the scores at the end of the tournament. player score Mai 93,005 Priya 101,012 Kiran 90,298 Noah 90,056 Clare 98,032 Elena 89,100 Andre -- 1. Rank the scores from highest to lowest. Who is in first place? 2. Andre\u2019s score was accidentally deleted but everyone agreed he is in second place. Could Andre\u2019s score be a six-digit number? Describe what Andre\u2019s score could be and give a couple of examples.", source_statement_join