eate the next 3 steps of Jada\u2019s pattern. Use pattern blocks or draw to continue Jada\u2019s pattern. 2. List the total number of blocks in each of the first 5 steps. Write 2 observations about the numbers in the pattern. 3. Will a step ever have a total of 25 blocks? Explain or show your reasoning."), admission(unclaimed_student_task_statement))}).

