 Ghana and uses the phrase \u201c. . . times as much as . . . .\u201d 2. A couple wants to spend only $350 at restaurants each month. How many more times could the couple go out to a restaurant each month if they eat in Ghana rather than in the United States? Show or explain your reasoning."), admission(unclaimed_student_task_statement))}).

defragged_task_instance(im_defrag_3645a454f6822205df64994d_1,
