    defragged_task{evidence_sha256:"6bace94bdc276157808c7cd05207255adffa61a927291542ca4cc7a6b44b87ad", status:already_complete, blocker:none, complete_statement:"Here are 3 situations. Which situations are true? Which situations are not true? Show how you know. \u2022 Situation A: A high-rise building has 53 stories. The first floor is 17 feet tall. All other stories are each 11 feet tall. The building is 589 feet tall. \u2022 Situation B: A window washer has 600 seconds to wash 17 windows of a building. It takes 54 seconds to wash each window. The washer finishes washing all the windows and has 11 seconds to spare. \u2022 Situation C: There are 11 students who set a goal to raise at least $600 for charity. Each student raises $17 each day. After 3 days of fundraising, the group needs $54 to meet their goal.", statement_joiner:" ", statement_segments:[seg_41d544656006e04ed258, seg_4f943202d75ec7924a13, seg_1d99f282df04341157b6, seg_7286cb30f42381cde888, seg_a22e296fd67fbcea38e8, seg_1b480c7881cae3d02e2d, seg_2e74e6951b28a8fb00e8, seg_3b023f8074a25e1dab38, seg_4d7a6ec33d13bf363c08, seg_111ab2672ca9210181cb, seg_df9b31e8b70799cd46dd, seg_ba31e3884f5dcf276fb3, seg_6777c60402c2cc1c3943, seg_886be86543f5ee54eced, seg_fd43f64b45fb7fa78d02, seg_150ac3b0bde74b70c397, seg_f74b3c45e9a26cd81f67], source_statement:"Here are 3 situations. Which situations are true? Which situations are not true? Show how you know. \u2022 Situation A: A high-rise building has 53 stories. The first floor is 17 feet tall. All other stories are each 11 feet tall. The building is 589 feet tall. \u2022 Situation B: A window washer has 600 seconds to wash 17 windows of a building. It takes 54 seconds to wash each window. The washer finishes washing all the windows and has 11 seconds to spare. \u2022 Situation C: There are 11 students who set a goal to raise at least $600 for charity. Each student raises $17 each day. After 3 days of fundraising, the group needs $54 to meet their goal.", source_statemen