nt this rectangle as a point on the coordinate grid. 4. If Jada\u2019s rectangle is 3 cm long, how wide is it? Represent this rectangle as a point on the coordinate grid. 5. If Jada draws a square, how long and wide is it? Explain how you know."), admission(unclaimed_student_task_statement))}).

