00 years ago. Today, it is 137 meters tall. The base of the pyramid is a square. Each side of the base is 230 meters long. If the pyramid was shaped like a rectangular prism, what would the volume of the prism be? 2. The Empire State Building is in New York City. The base is 129 meters by 57 meters. The building is 381 meters tall. Estimate the volume of the Empire State Building. 3. Which do you think is larger, the Great Pyramid or the Empire State Building? Explain or show your reasoning."), admission(unclaimed_student_task_statement))}).

